    "请从下方挑选正好 5 项最常用的发呆事件，它们会出现在快捷发布菜单中。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please select exactly 5 frequent events to appear in the quick menu."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
